              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awunakuhlanganiswa nabo ekumbelweni, ngokuba uchithile izwe lakho, wabulala abantu bakho; inzalo yabenzi bokubi ayisoze yaziwe.",
          "type": "text",
