              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lungiselelani abantwana bakhe ukuhlaba ngenxa yobubi bawoyise; funa bavuke badle izwe, bagcwalise ubuso bomhlaba ngemizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
