              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakuyenza ibe yifa lamagxolo ababayo namachibi amanzi; futhi ngokuqinisekile ngiyolishanela kanye nesilo esibhubhisayo,” kusho uJehova Sebawoti.",
          "type": "text",
