              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ungathokozi, Phalestina lonke, ngokuba udondolo lwalowo owakushaya lwaphukile; ngokuba empandeni yenyoka kuyakuphuma isihlahla seqhude, nesithelo saso sibe yinyoka evuthayo endizayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
